		/// The Staff survey table provides a high‑level assessment of  responses from staff participating in the Workforce Development Board (WDB) survey. It captures feedback on inter-agency collaboration, AJCC service delivery, referral processes, training needs, and organizational alignment.
		/// The dataset includes administrative attributes (e.g., district, role), as well as responses that assess communication effectiveness, partnership strength, co-location outcomes, and perceived service quality.
		/// This data are used to evaluate operational effectiveness, identify barriers and opportunities, and inform continuous improvement efforts across workforce programs and partner organizations.
		table StaffSurvey
